# Dependencies
node_modules/

# ── Personal documents. Nothing here is ever committed. ──
#
# This project is built by feeding it real tickets, so real tickets are always lying
# around while working on it. Everything a ticket could arrive as is excluded, and the
# few project images are re-included explicitly below.
#
# What *is* committed is tests/fixtures/*.json: redacted captures of a document's text
# *layout*, produced by tools/make-fixture.mjs. Names, references, addresses, telephone
# numbers and property names are replaced with same-shaped substitutes. Always read a
# new fixture before committing it — the tool cannot know every shape a name can take,
# and it has missed several: a salutation, a username, a hotel's name, a street address.
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.webp
*.eml
*.msg
*.png
samples/
tickets/

# Probe output. tools/probe-ui.mjs writes a screenshot per run, showing a real ticket.
probe-*.png

# The app's own artwork, which must be committed.
!icons/*.png
!icons/*.svg

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
_samples/
_movies/
